        "description": "<p><strong>Heat (Ex):</strong> Red-hot body deals extra fire damage on melee hits or each round when grappling — dice per statistics.</p><p><strong>Change size (Sp):</strong> Limited uses per day; works like <em>enlarge person</em> / <em>reduce person</em> and can target self — Fort negates; DC Charisma-based.</p><p><strong>Spell-like abilities:</strong> At will — <em>detect magic</em>, <em>produce flame</em>, <em>pyrotechnics</em>, single-ray <em>scorching ray</em>; 3/day — <em>invisibility</em>, <em>wall of fire</em>; 1/day — <em>gaseous form</em>, <em>permanent image</em>, limited <em>wish</em> grants to non-genies — CL and DCs per statistics.</p><p><strong>Change shape (Su):</strong> Small–Large humanoid or giant forms.</p><p><strong>Plane shift (Sp):</strong> As genie entry — carries linked creatures per statistics.</p><p><strong>Vulnerability:</strong> Cold per stat block; immunity to fire.</p>",
